# Fluid Tab Interaction — a 3-segment control (Accounts / Deposits / Funds):
# selecting a segment slides the white highlight there over 1 s, cross-fades
# label colours, and pulses a BlurView over the moving highlight and over the
# two labels involved (blur 0 -> 15 -> 0 through animated props).
# What this test covers: each segment in turn with the 1 s timing settled,
# jumping first <-> last (two cells), re-tapping the selected segment (early
# return, no blur), switching again mid-transition (cancelAnimation on the
# blur progress, translate retargeted), a rapid tap burst across all three,
# and a press-and-hold. Segments at y 437: x 80 / 201 / 321.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/fluid-tab-interaction"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 30000
wait "text" "Deposits" 30000
wait 1000
press 201 437
wait 1300
press 321 437
wait 1300
press 80 437
wait 1300
press 321 437
wait 1300
# Same segment again.
press 321 437
wait 800
# Mid-transition switches.
press 80 437
wait 300
press 201 437
wait 300
press 321 437
wait 1500
# Rapid burst.
press 80 437
wait 80
press 201 437
wait 80
press 321 437
wait 80
press 80 437
wait 80
press 321 437
wait 80
press 201 437
wait 1500
press 80 437 --count 4 --interval-ms 100
wait 1500
# Hold and release.
longpress 321 437 800
wait 1500
wait "text" "Funds" 8000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
